base-files (6) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * rc loads the kernel package's kexts.early, then starts kextd, again
    if it exits, and waits up to 5 s for its check-in. kextd loads the
    other kexts when IOKit matches one of their drivers to a device.
  * /etc/kexts.conf is removed. No package edits a list of kexts any more.

